async function logs(){const {logs}=await api('/logs');shell(`${pageHeading(i18n('Rekod latihan'),i18n('Latihan yang disimpan dan sesi yang belum selesai.'),button(i18n('Kembali ke kemajuan'),'progress','secondary'))}<div class="card">${logs.length?logs.map(l=>`<a class="exercise-row" href="#${l.ended_at?'log':'session'}/${l.id}"><div class="exercise-art">${icon('log')}</div><div class="exercise-info"><strong>${esc(systemText(l.session_label))}</strong><span>${fmt(l.scheduled_date)}</span></div>${badge(l.status)}${icon('chevron')}</a>`).join(''):empty(i18n('Log pertama kamu bermula di sini.'),i18n('Mulakan sesi latihan untuk merekod rep, beban dan usaha.'),'log')+button(i18n('Lihat sesi'),'dashboard')}</div>`,'logs');}
function setRows(e,locked){return Array.from({length:e.target_sets},(_,i)=>{const s=e.sets.find(s=>s.set_no===i+1);return i18n`<tr data-set="${i+1}"><td>${i+1}</td><td><input aria-label="Rep set ${i+1}" name="reps" type="number" min="1" max="100" step="1" value="${s?.reps||e.target_rep_max}" ${locked?'disabled':''}></td><td><input aria-label="Beban kg set ${i+1}" name="weight_kg" type="number" min="0" max="999" step="0.5" value="${s?.weight_kg??e.target_weight_kg??0}" ${locked?'disabled':''}></td><td><input aria-label="RPE set ${i+1}" name="rpe" type="number" min="1" max="10" step="1" value="${s?.rpe??''}" placeholder="1–10" ${locked?'disabled':''}></td><td><input aria-label="Set ${i+1} selesai" name="done" type="checkbox" ${s?'checked':''} ${locked?'disabled':''}></td></tr>`;}).join('');}
function collectSets(){return $$('[data-set]').filter(tr=>tr.querySelector('[name=done]').checked).map(tr=>({set_no:Number(tr.dataset.set),reps:Number(tr.querySelector('[name=reps]').value),weight_kg:Number(tr.querySelector('[name=weight_kg]').value),rpe:Number(tr.querySelector('[name=rpe]').value)}));}
function startTimer(resume=false){clearInterval(state.timer);if(resume!==true)state.restEndsAt=Date.now()+60000;const draw=()=>{const remaining=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((state.restEndsAt-Date.now())/1000));if($('#rest-time'))$('#rest-time').textContent=`${String(Math.floor(remaining/60)).padStart(2,'0')}:${String(remaining%60).padStart(2,'0')}`;if(!remaining){clearInterval(state.timer);state.restEndsAt=null;toast(i18n('Masa rehat selesai. Sedia untuk set seterusnya.'));}};state.timer=setInterval(draw,1000);draw();}
async function workout(id,isLog=false,index=0){let log=await api('/logs/'+id);if(log.ended_at&&!isLog){go('log/'+id);return;}index=Math.min(index,log.exercises.length-1);const e=log.exercises[index];if(!e)throw Error(i18n('Tiada senaman dalam sesi.'));
 shell(i18n`<div class="workout-stage">${pageHeading(isLog?i18n('Latihan disimpan'):esc(systemText(log.session_label)),fmt(log.scheduled_date),button(icon('back')+i18n(' Kembali'),isLog?'logs':'dashboard','secondary'))}<div class="card"><div class="row between wrap"><span class="eyebrow">SENAMAN ${index+1} DARIPADA ${log.exercises.length}</span>${workoutStatus(e,log.ended_at)}</div><div class="progress-bar" style="margin-top:17px"><span style="width:${(index+1)/log.exercises.length*100}%"></span></div><div class="workout-intro"><h2>${esc(e.name)}</h2><p class="muted small">${isLog?i18n('Semak set yang telah kamu simpan.'):i18n('Ikuti panduan, rekod set, kemudian teruskan ke senaman seterusnya.')}</p></div><div class="field" style="margin-top:22px"><label for="exercise-picker">Navigasi senaman</label><select id="exercise-picker">${log.exercises.map((x,i)=>`<option value="${i}" ${i===index?'selected':''}>${esc(x.name)} · ${log.ended_at?labels[x.status]:x.sets.length+'/'+x.target_sets+' set'}</option>`).join('')}</select></div>${!isLog?`<div class="workout-visual">${icon('dumbbell')}</div><p class="muted small">${esc(systemText(e.instructions))}</p>`:'<div style="height:22px"></div>'}<div class="targets"><div><strong>${e.target_sets}</strong><span>Set sasaran</span></div><div><strong>${e.target_rep_min}–${e.target_rep_max}</strong><span>Ulangan setiap set</span></div><div><strong>${e.target_weight_kg??i18n('Ringan')}${e.target_weight_kg!==null?' kg':''}</strong><span>Beban sasaran</span></div></div><form id="set-form"><div class="form-error"></div><table class="set-table"><thead><tr><th>Set</th><th>Ulangan</th><th>Berat (kg)</th><th>Usaha<br>(1–10)</th><th>Siap</th></tr></thead><tbody>${setRows(e,log.locked)}</tbody></table><p class="muted small">1. Buat ulangan yang disarankan. 2. Isi berat dan usaha (1 = mudah, 10 = paling sukar). 3. Tandakan Siap untuk simpan set. Berat badan sahaja? Isi 0 kg.</p><div class="field"><label for="notes">Nota senaman</label><textarea id="notes" name="notes" maxlength="200" ${log.locked?'disabled':''}>${esc(e.notes)}</textarea><small>Maksimum 200 aksara.</small></div>${log.ended_at?`<p class="small muted">${icon('lock')} ${log.locked?i18n('Log dikunci.'):i18n('Boleh diedit sehingga ')+fmt(log.edit_locked_at,{day:'numeric',month:'short',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})+'.'}</p>`:i18n`<div class="timer"><span>${icon('clock')} Rehat selepas set</span><strong id="rest-time">01:00</strong><button type="button" id="reset-timer" class="button ghost compact">Mula rehat 60s</button></div>`}<div class="form-actions">${log.locked?'':'<button class="button" type="submit">'+icon('check')+i18n(' Simpan perubahan</button>')}${index<log.exercises.length-1?i18n('<button class="button secondary" type="button" id="next-exercise">Senaman seterusnya ')+icon('arrow')+'</button>':''}</div></form></div>${!isLog?i18n('<button class="button secondary" style="width:100%;margin-top:20px" id="finish-session">Tamat sesi</button>'):''}</div>`,'logs');
 let dirty=false;const save=async()=>{log=await api(`/logs/${id}/exercises/${e.id}`,'PUT',{sets:collectSets(),notes:$('#notes').value});dirty=false;const saved=log.exercises.find(x=>x.id===e.id);if($('#exercise-save-status')&&saved)$('#exercise-save-status').textContent=saved.sets.length+' / '+saved.target_sets+i18n(' set disimpan');};
 $('#set-form').addEventListener('input',()=>dirty=true);bindForm('#set-form',async()=>{await save();toast(i18n('Log berjaya disimpan.'));});
 $('#exercise-picker').onchange=async ev=>{try{if(dirty&&!log.locked)await save();workout(id,isLog,Number(ev.target.value));}catch(err){toast(err.message);ev.target.value=index;}};
 if($('#next-exercise'))$('#next-exercise').onclick=async()=>{try{if(!log.locked)await save();workout(id,isLog,index+1);}catch(err){toast(err.message);}};
 if($('#reset-timer'))$('#reset-timer').onclick=startTimer;
 if(!isLog){$$('[name=done]').forEach(c=>c.onchange=async()=>{try{await save();if(c.checked)startTimer();toast(i18n('Set disimpan.'));}catch(err){c.checked=!c.checked;toast(err.message);}});$('#finish-session').onclick=()=>confirmAction(i18n('Tamatkan sesi?'),i18n('Set yang belum direkod akan ditanda terlepas. Kamu masih boleh mengedit log selama 24 jam.'),async()=>{await save();await api('/sessions/'+id+'/finish','POST',{});go('log/'+id);});}
}
async function progress(){const {exercises}=await api('/exercises');state.exerciseId ||=String(exercises[0]?.id||'');const d=await api(`/progress?exerciseId=${state.exerciseId}&range=${state.range}`);shell(i18n`${pageHeading(i18n('Kemajuan kamu'),i18n('Setiap latihan yang disimpan ialah satu langkah ke hadapan.'),i18n`<div class="tabs"><button data-range="week" class="${state.range==='week'?'active':''}">Minggu</button><button data-range="month" class="${state.range==='month'?'active':''}">Bulan</button></div>`)}<div class="row wrap" style="margin-bottom:24px">${button(i18n('Lihat semua rekod latihan'),'logs','secondary')}</div><div class="progress-metrics">${[[i18n('Konsistensi'),d.consistency+'%',i18n('Sesi siap ÷ (siap + terlepas)'),'chart'],[i18n('Latihan berturut-turut'),d.streak+i18n(' sesi'),i18n('Sesi dirancang berturut-turut'),'flame'],[i18n('Sesi siap'),d.completed,i18n('Dalam julat yang dipilih'),'check'],[i18n('Sesi terlepas'),d.missed,i18n('Dalam julat yang dipilih'),'calendar']].map(([title,n,note,i])=>`<div class="card stat-card"><div class="row between"><small>${title}</small><span class="stat-icon">${icon(i)}</span></div><strong>${n}</strong><p>${note}</p></div>`).join('')}</div><section class="card"><div class="card-title"><h2>Berat yang berjaya diangkat</h2>${icon('chart')}</div><div class="field" style="max-width:300px;margin-bottom:25px"><label for="progress-exercise">Pilih senaman</label><select id="progress-exercise">${exercises.map(e=>`<option value="${e.id}" ${String(e.id)===state.exerciseId?'selected':''}>${esc(e.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="chart-box"><canvas id="progress-chart" role="img" aria-label="Graf beban tertinggi setiap sesi"></canvas>${!d.points.length?i18n('<div class="chart-empty">Rekod sesi pertama untuk melihat graf kemajuan.</div>'):''}</div>${d.points.length?i18n`<details class="small"><summary>Lihat data graf</summary><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Tarikh</th><th>Beban tertinggi</th></tr></thead><tbody>${d.points.map(p=>`<tr><td>${fmt(p.scheduled_date)}</td><td>${p.top_weight_kg} kg</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></details>`:''}<p class="muted small" style="margin:18px 0 0">Konsistensi menggunakan sesi selesai dan terlepas, termasuk hari ini. Hari rehat tidak memutuskan rentak latihan.</p></section>`,'progress');
 if(window.Chart){state.chart=new Chart($('#progress-chart'),{type:'line',data:{labels:d.points.map(p=>fmt(p.scheduled_date,{day:'numeric',month:'short'})),datasets:[{label:i18n('Beban (kg)'),data:d.points.map(p=>p.top_weight_kg),borderColor:'#ab9bff',backgroundColor:'rgba(168,134,237,0.18)',fill:true,tension:.3,pointRadius:5,pointBackgroundColor:'#ffffff',pointBorderColor:'#a886ed',pointBorderWidth:2}]},options:{responsive:true,maintainAspectRatio:false,plugins:{legend:{display:false}},scales:{y:{beginAtZero:true,grid:{color:'#2a3147'},ticks:{color:'#a9b1c8'},title:{display:true,text:i18n('Beban (kg)'),color:'#5141b5'}},x:{grid:{display:false},ticks:{color:'#a99ebc'}}}}});}
 updateChartTheme();
 $('#progress-exercise').onchange=e=>{state.exerciseId=e.target.value;progress();};$$('[data-range]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.range=b.dataset.range;progress();});
}
function passwordForm(){return i18n`<h2>Tukar kata laluan</h2><form id="password-form"><div class="form-error"></div><div class="form-grid">${field(i18n('Kata laluan lama'),'old_password','','password','required autocomplete="current-password"')}${field(i18n('Kata laluan baharu'),'new_password','','password','required minlength="8" maxlength="72" autocomplete="new-password"')}${field(i18n('Sahkan kata laluan baharu'),'confirm_password','','password','required minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password"')}</div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button secondary" type="submit">Tukar kata laluan</button></div></form>`;}
function bindPassword(){bindForm('#password-form',async(d,form)=>{const r=await api('/auth/change-password','POST',d);state.csrf=r.csrf;form.reset();toast(r.message);});}
async function profilePage(){const {profile:p}=await api('/profile');const initials=state.user.full_name.split(' ').slice(0,2).map(n=>n[0]).join('');shell(pageHeading(i18n('Profil latihan kamu'),i18n('Satu tempat untuk membentuk rutin, jadual dan pilihan kamu.'))+'<div class="profile-studio"><aside class="card profile-passport"><div class="avatar">'+esc(initials)+'</div><span class="eyebrow">' + i18n('AHLI FITADAPT') + '</span><h2 style="margin-top:14px">'+esc(state.user.full_name)+'</h2><p>'+esc(state.user.email)+'</p><dl class="identity-list">'+[[i18n('Matlamat'),labels[p.goal]],[i18n('Pengalaman'),labels[p.level]],[i18n('Hari latihan'),p.days.length+i18n(' / minggu')],[i18n('Masa'),p.session_minutes+i18n(' minit')]].map(([k,v])=>'<div><dt>'+k+'</dt><dd>'+esc(v)+'</dd></div>').join('')+'<a href="#logout" class="button ghost">'+icon('logout')+i18n(' Log keluar</a></aside><div class="stack"><section class="card"><div class="form-section-title"><span>01 / PILIHAN LATIHAN</span><h2>Rutin yang sesuai dengan kamu</h2></div><form id="profile-form"><div class="form-error"></div><div class="form-grid">')+field(i18n('Nama penuh'),'full_name',state.user.full_name,'text','required maxlength="100"')+field(i18n('E-mel'),'email',state.user.email,'email','disabled')+profileFields(p)+'</div><div class="alert">'+icon('spark')+i18n(' Perubahan latihan digunakan mulai esok. Rekod lepas dan sesi hari ini dikekalkan.</div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button" id="profile-submit" type="submit">Simpan perubahan ')+icon('check')+i18n('</button></div></form></section><section class="card"><div class="form-section-title"><span>02 / KESELAMATAN AKAUN</span></div>')+passwordForm()+i18n('</section><section class="card"><div class="row between wrap"><div><h3>Jadikan FitAdapt lebih baik.</h3><p class="muted small" style="margin:0">Kongsi pengalaman latihan kamu dengan kami.</p></div>')+button(i18n('Beri maklum balas'),'feedback','secondary')+'</div></section></div></div>','profile');bindDays();bindForm('#profile-form',async(d,form)=>{await api('/profile','PUT',{...parseProfile(d,form),plan_start_date:p.plan_start_date});state.user.full_name=d.full_name;await profilePage();toast(i18n('Profil berjaya dikemas kini.'));});bindPassword();}
function feedback(){shell(i18n`<div class="narrow">${pageHeading(i18n('Suara kamu penting.'),i18n('Bantu kami membina pengalaman latihan yang lebih baik.'))}<section class="card"><form id="feedback-form"><div class="form-error"></div>${[['ease_score',i18n('1. Sejauh mana FitAdapt mudah digunakan?'),i18n('Sangat sukar'),i18n('Sangat mudah')],['clarity_score',i18n('2. Adakah pelan latihan kamu jelas?'),i18n('Tidak jelas'),i18n('Sangat jelas')],['adjustment_score',i18n('3. Adakah pelarasan automatik membantu?'),i18n('Tidak membantu'),i18n('Sangat membantu')]].map(([n,q,l,r])=>`<fieldset style="margin-bottom:30px"><legend>${q}</legend><div class="feedback-scale">${[1,2,3,4,5].map(i=>`<label><input type="radio" name="${n}" value="${i}" required><span>${i}</span></label>`).join('')}</div><div class="row between muted" style="font-size:10px"><span>${l}</span><span>${r}</span></div></fieldset>`).join('')}<div class="field"><label for="comments">Apa yang boleh kami perbaiki?</label><textarea id="comments" name="comments" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Kongsikan pengalaman atau cadangan kamu…"></textarea></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button" type="submit">Hantar maklum balas ${icon('arrow')}</button></div></form></section></div>`,'profile');bindForm('#feedback-form',async d=>{await api('/feedback','POST',{...d,ease_score:Number(d.ease_score),clarity_score:Number(d.clarity_score),adjustment_score:Number(d.adjustment_score)});shell(`<div class="card narrow">${empty(i18n('Terima kasih!'),i18n('Maklum balas kamu membantu kami membina FitAdapt yang lebih baik.'),'message')}<div style="text-align:center">${button(i18n('Kembali ke dashboard'),'dashboard')}</div></div>`,'profile');});}
async function adaptations(){const {events}=await api('/adaptations');shell(`${pageHeading(i18n('Pelan yang berkembang bersama kamu.'),i18n('Setiap pelarasan ada sebabnya.'))}<section class="card">${events.length?events.map(e=>`<div class="list-item"><div class="row between"><span class="badge">${esc(e.rule_code)}</span><small>${fmt(e.created_at)}</small></div><p>${esc(systemText(e.reason_text))}</p>${e.new_value!==null?`<small>${esc(e.old_value)} → ${esc(e.new_value)} kg</small>`:''}</div>`).join(''):empty(i18n('Pelan kamu baru bermula.'),i18n('Pelarasan akan muncul selepas kamu merekod latihan atau terlepas sesi.'),'spark')}</section>`,'plan');}
async function adminDashboard(){const d=await api('/admin/dashboard');const actionLabels={'exercise.save':i18n('Senaman disimpan'),'exercise.activate':i18n('Senaman diaktifkan'),'exercise.deactivate':i18n('Senaman dinyahaktifkan'),'account.suspended':i18n('Akaun digantung'),'account.active':i18n('Akaun diaktifkan'),'account.delete':i18n('Akaun dipadam')};shell(i18n`${pageHeading(i18n('Gambaran keseluruhan.'),i18n('Pantau aktiviti dan urus komuniti FitAdapt.'))}<div class="grid3">${[[i18n('Jumlah pengguna'),d.users,d.userChange,'users'],[i18n('Senaman aktif'),d.exercises,d.exerciseChange,'dumbbell'],[i18n('Sesi dilog minggu ini'),d.logs,d.logChange,'log']].map(([title,n,change,i])=>`<div class="card stat-card"><div class="row between"><small>${title}</small><span class="stat-icon">${icon(i)}</span></div><strong>${n}</strong><p>${change===null?i18n('Belum ada asas perbandingan'):i18n`<span style="color:var(--green)">${change>=0?'+':''}${change}%</span> berbanding minggu lalu`}</p></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="grid2" style="margin-top:25px"><section class="card"><h2>Pautan pantas</h2>${[['admin-exercises','dumbbell',i18n('Urus senaman'),i18n('Tambah dan kemas kini katalog latihan.')],['admin-users','users',i18n('Urus akaun'),i18n('Urus akses dan status pengguna.')],['admin-feedback','message',i18n('Maklum balas'),i18n('Fahami pengalaman pengguna.')]].map(([url,i,title,text])=>`<a class="exercise-row" href="#${url}"><div class="exercise-art">${icon(i)}</div><div class="exercise-info"><strong>${title}</strong><span>${text}</span></div>${icon('chevron')}</a>`).join('')}</section><section class="card"><h2>Aktiviti pentadbir</h2>${d.audit.length?d.audit.map(a=>`<div class="list-item"><strong class="small">${esc(actionLabels[a.action]||a.action)}</strong><p class="muted small">${esc(a.full_name||i18n('Akaun dipadam'))} · ${fmt(a.created_at)}</p></div>`).join(''):empty(i18n('Belum ada aktiviti.'),i18n('Tindakan pentadbir akan direkodkan di sini.'),'shield')}</section></div>`,'admin');}
function pagination(d){return i18n`<div class="pagination"><span>${d.total?i18n('Memaparkan ')+((d.page-1)*8+1)+'–'+Math.min(d.page*8,d.total)+i18n(' daripada ')+d.total:i18n('Tiada rekod')}</span><div class="row"><button class="button secondary compact" data-page="${d.page-1}" ${d.page<=1?'disabled':''}>Sebelum</button><span>${d.page} / ${d.pages}</span><button class="button secondary compact" data-page="${d.page+1}" ${d.page>=d.pages?'disabled':''}>Seterusnya</button></div></div>`;}
function filterSelect(name,placeholder,values,value){return `<select class="filter-input" name="${name}" aria-label="${placeholder}"><option value="">${placeholder}</option>${values.map(v=>`<option value="${v}" ${v===value?'selected':''}>${labels[v]||v}</option>`).join('')}</select>`;}
async function adminExercises(query={}){state.adminExerciseQuery=query;const d=await api('/admin/exercises?'+new URLSearchParams(query));shell(i18n`${pageHeading(i18n('Urus senaman.'),i18n('Katalog latihan untuk setiap tahap dan peralatan.'),'<button class="button" id="add-exercise">'+icon('plus')+i18n(' Tambah senaman</button>'))}<section class="card"><form class="filters" id="exercise-filter"><input class="filter-input" name="search" aria-label="Cari senaman" placeholder="Cari nama senaman…" value="${esc(query.search||'')}">${filterSelect('muscle',i18n('Semua otot'),['chest','back','legs','shoulders','arms','core'],query.muscle)}${filterSelect('equipment',i18n('Semua peralatan'),['bodyweight','dumbbell','barbell','machine','cable'],query.equipment)}<button class="button secondary" type="submit">Cari</button><button class="button ghost" type="button" id="reset-filter">Reset</button></form><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Nama senaman</th><th>Otot sasaran</th><th>Peralatan</th><th>Tahap</th><th>Status</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody>${d.items.map(e=>i18n`<tr><td><strong>${esc(e.name)}</strong><div class="muted">${e.default_sets} set × ${e.default_rep_min}–${e.default_rep_max} rep</div></td><td>${labels[e.muscle_group]}</td><td>${labels[e.equipment_type]}</td><td>${labels[e.level]}</td><td>${badge(e.is_active?'active':i18n('Tidak aktif'))}</td><td><div class="row"><button class="button secondary compact" data-edit="${e.id}">Ubah</button><button class="button ghost compact" data-toggle="${e.id}">${e.is_active?i18n('Nyahaktif'):i18n('Aktifkan')}</button></div></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>${!d.total?empty(i18n('Tiada senaman ditemui.'),i18n('Cuba ubah carian atau penapis.'),'dumbbell'):''}</div>${pagination(d)}</section><div class="alert" style="margin-top:22px">${icon('shield')} Senaman yang digunakan dalam pelan atau log dikekalkan dalam sejarah. Nyahaktifkan untuk mengecualikannya daripada pelan baharu.</div>`,'admin-exercises');
 $('#exercise-filter').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();adminExercises(formData(e.target));};$('#reset-filter').onclick=()=>adminExercises();$$('[data-page]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>adminExercises({...query,page:b.dataset.page}));$('#add-exercise').onclick=()=>exerciseModal(null,()=>adminExercises(query));$$('[data-edit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>exerciseModal(d.items.find(e=>e.id===Number(b.dataset.edit)),()=>adminExercises(query)));$$('[data-toggle]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const e=d.items.find(e=>e.id===Number(b.dataset.toggle));confirmAction(e.is_active?i18n('Nyahaktifkan senaman?'):i18n('Aktifkan senaman?'),esc(e.name),async()=>{await api('/admin/exercises/'+e.id+'/active','PATCH',{is_active:!e.is_active});await adminExercises(query);toast(i18n('Status senaman dikemas kini.'));});});
}
function exerciseModal(existing,refresh){const e=existing||{name:'',muscle_group:'chest',equipment_type:'bodyweight',level:'beginner',split_tag:'push',movement_focus:'none',default_sets:3,default_rep_min:8,default_rep_max:12,load_increment_kg:0,base_load_beginner_kg:0,base_load_intermediate_kg:0,is_active:1,is_compound:1,tags:[],instructions:'',image_url:''};modal(existing?i18n('Ubah senaman'):i18n('Tambah senaman'),i18n`<form id="exercise-form"><div class="form-error"></div><div class="form-grid">${field(i18n('Nama senaman'),'name',e.name,'text','required maxlength="100"')}${select(i18n('Otot sasaran'),'muscle_group',['chest','back','legs','shoulders','arms','core'],e.muscle_group)}${select(i18n('Peralatan'),'equipment_type',['bodyweight','dumbbell','barbell','machine','cable'],e.equipment_type)}${select(i18n('Tahap'),'level',['beginner','intermediate','advanced'],e.level)}<h3 class="field full" style="margin:10px 0 0">Tetapan latihan</h3>${select(i18n('Kategori split'),'split_tag',['push','pull','legs','core'],e.split_tag)}${select(i18n('Fokus pergerakan'),'movement_focus',['none','squat','hinge'],e.movement_focus)}${field(i18n('Set lalai'),'default_sets',e.default_sets,'number','required min="1" max="6"')}${field(i18n('Rep minimum'),'default_rep_min',e.default_rep_min,'number','required min="1" max="30"')}${field(i18n('Rep maksimum'),'default_rep_max',e.default_rep_max,'number','required min="1" max="50"')}${field(i18n('Kenaikan beban (kg)'),'load_increment_kg',e.load_increment_kg,'number','required min="0" max="20" step="0.5"')}${field(i18n('Beban pemula (kg)'),'base_load_beginner_kg',e.base_load_beginner_kg??'','number','min="0" max="999" step="0.5"')}${field(i18n('Beban sederhana (kg)'),'base_load_intermediate_kg',e.base_load_intermediate_kg??'','number','min="0" max="999" step="0.5"')}<div class="field full"><label for="instructions">Arahan senaman</label><textarea id="instructions" name="instructions" maxlength="3000">${esc(e.instructions)}</textarea></div>${field(i18n('URL gambar (HTTPS)'),'image_url',e.image_url||'','url','maxlength="255"')}<fieldset class="field full"><legend>Tag limitasi</legend><div class="row wrap">${[['knee',i18n('Lutut')],['back',i18n('Belakang')],['shoulder',i18n('Bahu')],['wrist',i18n('Pergelangan')],['elbow',i18n('Siku')],['neck',i18n('Leher')]].map(([value,label])=>`<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="tags" value="${value}" ${e.tags.includes(value)?'checked':''}>${label}</label>`).join('')}</div></fieldset><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="is_compound" ${e.is_compound?'checked':''}>Senaman sendi besar</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="is_active" ${e.is_active?'checked':''}>Senaman aktif</label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="button" type="submit">Simpan senaman</button></div></form>`);bindForm('#exercise-form',async(data,form)=>{for(const k of ['default_sets','default_rep_min','default_rep_max','load_increment_kg'])data[k]=Number(data[k]);for(const k of ['base_load_beginner_kg','base_load_intermediate_kg'])data[k]=data[k]===''?null:Number(data[k]);data.tags=[...form.querySelectorAll('[name=tags]:checked')].map(n=>n.value);data.is_compound=Number(!!data.is_compound);data.is_active=Number(!!data.is_active);await api('/admin/exercises'+(existing?'/'+e.id:''),existing?'PUT':'POST',data);$('#modal').close();toast(i18n('Senaman disimpan.'));await refresh();});}
async function adminUsers(query={}){state.adminUserQuery=query;const d=await api('/admin/users?'+new URLSearchParams(query));shell(i18n`${pageHeading(i18n('Urus akaun.'),i18n('Urus keahlian dan akses dengan selamat.'))}<section class="card"><form class="filters" id="users-filter"><input class="filter-input" name="search" aria-label="Cari pengguna" placeholder="Cari nama atau e-mel…" value="${esc(query.search||'')}">${filterSelect('role',i18n('Semua peranan'),['user','admin','coach'],query.role)}<button class="button secondary" type="submit">Cari</button><button class="button ghost" type="button" id="reset-filter">Reset</button></form><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Nama / e-mel</th><th>Peranan</th><th>Status</th><th>Tarikh daftar</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody>${d.items.map(u=>`<tr><td><strong>${esc(u.full_name)}</strong><div class="muted">${esc(u.email)}</div></td><td>${labels[u.role]}</td><td>${badge(u.status)}</td><td>${fmt(u.created_at,{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric'})}</td><td>${u.id===state.user.id?i18n('<span class="muted">Akaun anda</span>'):i18n`<div class="row"><button class="button secondary compact" data-status="${u.id}">${u.status==='active'?i18n('Gantung'):i18n('Aktifkan')}</button><button class="button danger compact" data-delete="${u.id}">Padam</button></div>`}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>${!d.total?empty(i18n('Tiada akaun ditemui.'),i18n('Cuba carian lain.'),'users'):''}</div>${pagination(d)}</section><div class="alert" style="margin-top:22px">${icon('shield')} Pentadbir tidak mempunyai akses kepada log latihan peribadi pengguna.</div>`,'admin-users');$('#users-filter').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();adminUsers(formData(e.target));};$('#reset-filter').onclick=()=>adminUsers();$$('[data-page]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>adminUsers({...query,page:b.dataset.page}));$$('[data-status]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const u=d.items.find(u=>u.id===Number(b.dataset.status));confirmAction(u.status==='active'?i18n('Gantung akaun?'):i18n('Aktifkan akaun?'),esc(u.full_name)+(u.status==='active'?i18n(' akan dilog keluar serta-merta.'):''),async()=>{await api('/admin/users/'+u.id+'/status','PATCH',{status:u.status==='active'?'suspended':'active'});await adminUsers(query);});});$$('[data-delete]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const u=d.items.find(u=>u.id===Number(b.dataset.delete));confirmAction(i18n('Padam akaun secara kekal?'),i18n`Akaun ${esc(u.full_name)}, profil, pelan dan lognya akan dipadam. Tindakan ini tidak boleh dibatalkan.`,async()=>{await api('/admin/users/'+u.id,'DELETE',{confirm:true});await adminUsers(query);});});}
async function adminFeedback(page=1){state.adminFeedbackPage=page;const d=await api('/admin/feedback?page='+page);shell(i18n`${pageHeading(i18n('Maklum balas pengguna.'),i18n('Dengar, fahami, dan tingkatkan pengalaman FitAdapt.'),'<a class="button secondary" href="/api/admin/feedback/export" download>'+icon('download')+i18n(' Eksport CSV</a>'))}<div class="grid3" style="margin-bottom:24px">${[[i18n('Kemudahan penggunaan'),'ease'],[i18n('Kejelasan pelan'),'clarity'],[i18n('Kegunaan pelarasan'),'adjustment']].map(([title,key])=>i18n`<div class="card stat-card"><small>${title}</small><strong>${d.averages[key]===null?'—':Number(d.averages[key]).toFixed(1)} <span class="small muted">/ 5</span></strong><p>${d.averages.total} maklum balas</p></div>`).join('')}</div><section class="card"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data"><thead><tr><th>Pengguna</th><th>Mudah</th><th>Jelas</th><th>Membantu</th><th>Komen</th><th>Tarikh</th></tr></thead><tbody>${d.items.map(f=>`<tr><td>${esc(f.full_name)}</td><td>${f.ease_score}/5</td><td>${f.clarity_score}/5</td><td>${f.adjustment_score}/5</td><td class="comment">${esc(f.comments||'—')}</td><td>${fmt(f.created_at,{day:'numeric',month:'short'})}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table>${!d.total?empty(i18n('Belum ada maklum balas.'),i18n('Jawapan pengguna akan muncul di sini.'),'message'):''}</div>${pagination(d)}</section>`,'admin-feedback');$$('[data-page]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>adminFeedback(b.dataset.page));}
function legal(privacy){$('#app').innerHTML=`<header class="public-header">${brand()}${button(i18n('Kembali'),'register','secondary')}</header><main id="main" class="legal card"><h1>${privacy?i18n('Dasar privasi'):i18n('Terma penggunaan')}</h1>${privacy?i18n('<p>FitAdapt menyimpan nama, e-mel, profil latihan, limitasi yang anda masukkan, pelan, log set dan maklum balas untuk menyediakan fungsi aplikasi.</p><p>Kata laluan disimpan sebagai hash. Kuki sesi digunakan untuk mengesahkan log masuk. Pentadbir boleh mengurus akaun dan melihat maklum balas, tetapi tidak diberi akses kepada log latihan peribadi melalui aplikasi.</p><p>Data kekal sehingga akaun dipadam oleh pentadbir. Hubungi pentadbir pemasangan FitAdapt anda untuk permintaan akses atau pemadaman. Tiada penjejak pengiklanan digunakan oleh aplikasi ini.</p>'):i18n('<p>FitAdapt menyediakan panduan latihan umum berdasarkan maklumat dan rekod yang anda masukkan. Gunakan beban yang sesuai dengan kebolehan anda dan hentikan latihan jika terasa sakit.</p><p>Anda bertanggungjawab menjaga kata laluan dan memberikan maklumat yang tepat. Jangan gunakan aplikasi untuk mengakses akaun orang lain atau mengganggu perkhidmatan.</p><p>Pelarasan automatik ialah cadangan berasaskan peraturan dan tidak menggantikan nasihat jurulatih atau profesional kesihatan. Hubungi pentadbir pemasangan ini untuk bantuan akaun.</p>')}</main>`;}
let renderVersion=0;
async function render(view={}){if(!view.preserveDraft)state.restEndsAt=null;authModule?.unmountAuth();const version=++renderVersion;state.chart?.destroy();state.chart=null;clearInterval(state.timer);if($('#modal').open)$('#modal').close();if($('#setup-dialog')?.open)$('#setup-dialog').close();const [rawRoute,id]=location.hash.slice(1).split('/');const route=rawRoute||'home';
 try{
  if(['terms','privacy'].includes(route)){legal(route==='privacy');return;}
  if(state.user?.role==='user'&&!state.onboarded&&!['logout','onboarding'].includes(route)){go('onboarding');return;}
  if(route==='home'||route==='how'){landing();if(route==='how')$('#how').scrollIntoView();return;}
  if(route==='login'||route==='register'){await authPage(route==='register');return;}
  if(!state.user){go('login');return;}
  if(route==='logout'){await api('/auth/logout','POST',{});state.user=null;state.csrf='';state.token='';localStorage.removeItem('fitadapt_token');go('login');return;}
  if(state.user.role==='admin'&&!route.startsWith('admin')){go('admin');return;}
  if(state.user.role!=='admin'&&route.startsWith('admin')){go('dashboard');return;}
  if(state.user.role==='user'&&!state.onboarded&&route!=='onboarding'){go('onboarding');return;}
  const routes={dashboard,plan,logs,progress,profile:profilePage,onboarding,feedback,adaptations,admin:adminDashboard,'admin-exercises':adminExercises,'admin-users':adminUsers,'admin-feedback':adminFeedback,'admin-profile':()=>{shell(`<div class="narrow">${pageHeading(i18n('Profil pentadbir.'),esc(state.user.email))}<section class="card">${passwordForm()}</section></div>`,'admin');bindPassword();}};
  if(route==='session'||route==='log')await workout(id,route==='log',view.exerciseIndex||0);else if(view.reload)await view.reload();else if(routes[route])await routes[route]();else go(state.user.role==='admin'?'admin':'dashboard');
 }catch(e){if(version!==renderVersion)return;if(e.status===401){state.user=null;go('login');return;}if(state.user)shell(i18n`${pageHeading(i18n('Halaman belum dapat dimuatkan.'),i18n('Sila cuba lagi sebentar.'))}<div class="alert error">${esc(systemText(e.message))}</div><button class="button" id="retry" style="margin-top:20px">Cuba lagi</button>`);else $('#app').innerHTML=`<main id="main" class="legal"><div class="alert error">${esc(systemText(e.message))}</div>${button(i18n('Kembali'),'home')}</main>`;if($('#retry'))$('#retry').onclick=render;}
 window.scrollTo(0,0);
}
function updateChartTheme(){
 if(!state.chart)return;
 const css=getComputedStyle(document.documentElement),muted=css.getPropertyValue('--muted'),line=css.getPropertyValue('--line'),accent=css.getPropertyValue('--purple');
 const chart=state.chart;
 chart.data.datasets[0].borderColor=accent;chart.data.datasets[0].pointBackgroundColor=css.getPropertyValue('--card');
 chart.options.scales.y.grid.color=line;chart.options.scales.y.ticks.color=muted;chart.options.scales.x.ticks.color=muted;chart.options.scales.y.title.color=muted;
 chart.update('none');
}
let preferenceRefresh=Promise.resolve();
window.addEventListener('fitadapt:preferences',event=>{
 if(event.detail.kind==='theme'){updateChartTheme();return;}
 preferenceRefresh=preferenceRefresh.then(async()=>{
  refreshLanguageLabels();
  if(['#login','#register'].includes(location.hash))return; // React updates without remounting its form.
  if($('#modal').open){$('#modal').addEventListener('close',()=>window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('fitadapt:preferences',{detail:{kind:'language'}})),{once:true});return;}
  const hash=location.hash,scroll=window.scrollY,dialogScroll=$('#setup-dialog')?.scrollTop||0;
  const controls=$$('#app input,#app select,#app textarea,#setup-dialog input,#setup-dialog select,#setup-dialog textarea').filter(el=>!el.dataset.preference);
  const snapshot=controls.map(el=>({name:el.name,id:el.id,type:el.type,value:el.value,checked:el.checked}));
  const openDetails=$$('#app details,#setup-dialog details').map(el=>el.open);
  const exerciseIndex=Number($('#exercise-picker')?.value||0),selectedDate=$('[data-plan-date][aria-pressed=true]')?.dataset.planDate;
  const active=document.activeElement,focusedPreference=active?.dataset.preference;
  const focusedControl=controls.indexOf(active),selection=active?.selectionStart;
  const setup=$('#onboarding-form');
  if(setup&&state.step===1)Object.assign(state.onboarding,formData(setup));
  if(setup&&state.step===2)Object.assign(state.onboarding,parseProfile(formData(setup),setup));
  // Rebuild authored labels, then restore the in-memory draft without writing to the API.
  const reload=hash==='#admin-exercises'?()=>adminExercises(state.adminExerciseQuery):hash==='#admin-users'?()=>adminUsers(state.adminUserQuery):hash==='#admin-feedback'?()=>adminFeedback(state.adminFeedbackPage):null;
  await render({exerciseIndex,preserveDraft:true,reload});
  if(location.hash!==hash)return;
  const restored=$$('#app input,#app select,#app textarea,#setup-dialog input,#setup-dialog select,#setup-dialog textarea').filter(el=>!el.dataset.preference);
  snapshot.forEach((saved,i)=>{
   const el=restored[i];if(!el||el.name!==saved.name||el.id!==saved.id)return;
   el.value=saved.value;if(['checkbox','radio'].includes(saved.type))el.checked=saved.checked;
  });
  $$('#app details,#setup-dialog details').forEach((el,i)=>{el.open=openDetails[i]||false;});
  if($('#day-count'))bindDays();
  if($('#schedule-minutes'))$('#session_minutes').dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));
  // Input marks the workout draft dirty, but does not auto-save or start another timer.
  if($('#set-form'))$('#notes').dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));
  if(selectedDate)$('[data-plan-date="'+selectedDate+'"]')?.click();
  if(state.restEndsAt&&$('#rest-time'))startTimer(true);
  const focusTarget=focusedPreference?document.querySelector(($('#setup-dialog')?.open?'#setup-dialog':'#display-toolbar')+' [data-preference="'+focusedPreference+'"]'):restored[focusedControl];
  focusTarget?.focus({preventScroll:true});if(selection!==null&&selection!==undefined&&focusTarget?.setSelectionRange&&['text','search','password','email'].includes(focusTarget.type)){try{focusTarget.setSelectionRange(selection,selection);}catch{}}
  window.scrollTo(0,scroll);if($('#setup-dialog'))$('#setup-dialog').scrollTop=dialogScroll;
  updateChartTheme();
 }).catch(e=>toast(e.message));
});
window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>render());
window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection',event=>{toast(event.reason?.message||i18n('Ralat tidak dijangka. Sila cuba lagi.'));});
(async()=>{try{const me=await api('/auth/me');if(me.token){state.token=me.token;localStorage.setItem('fitadapt_token',me.token);}Object.assign(state,me);}catch{}await render();})();
